  "interpretation": "<ul>\n<li data-start=\"1076\" data-end=\"1116\">\n<p data-start=\"1078\" data-end=\"1116\"><span style=\"font-size: 9px;\"><strong data-start=\"1078\" data-end=\"1088\">Normal</strong>: No evidence of neuropathy.</span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 9px;\" data-start=\"1117\" data-end=\"1198\">\n<p data-start=\"1119\" data-end=\"1198\"><span style=\"font-size: 9px;\"><strong data-start=\"1119\" data-end=\"1152\">Reduced velocity or amplitude</strong>: Suggests demyelination or axonal neuropathy.</span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 9px;\" data-start=\"1199\" data-end=\"1291\">\n<p data-start=\"1201\" data-end=\"1291\"><span style=\"font-size: 9px;\"><strong data-start=\"1201\" data-end=\"1222\">Prolonged latency</strong>: Possible nerve compression or systemic neuropathy (e.g., diabetes).</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>",
